UI (USER INTERFACE ) is the visual part of a website or application that users interact with. 
It includes buttons, menus, icons, colors and layouts.
A good UI focuses on clarity, consistency, attractiveness, making digital
and visuial  products easy to navigate, visually appealing, and efficient for users to accomplish tasks.
Caption-Where creativity meets functionality

UX (USER EXPERIENCE)
UX focuses on creating a seamless interaction between users and the website or application. 
It emphasizes Easy to use navigation, responsive design, visual consistency, accessibility, 
and fast performance to ensure users can easily achieve their goals while enjoying a smooth and satisfying experience.
Caption-Simplifying user journeys with thoughtful and efficient interfaces

React is a popular JavaScript library used for building fast and interactive user interfaces
especially for single-page applications. 
It follows a component-based architecture, allowing developers to create reusable UI elements. 
React improves performance through the Virtual DOM and makes frontend development more efficient, scalable, 
and easy to maintain.
Caption-Building dynamic and reusable user interfaces with ease

JS(JavaScripts) Adds interactivity to websites.
Responds to user actions like clicks.
Updates content dynamically.
Validates form inputs.
Creates animations and effects.
Runs directly in web browsers.
HTML creates the structure and CSS adds design, JavaScript adds functionality.
Caption-The Language of Interactive Web Pages

HTML ( HyperText Markup Language).
It is used to create the structure of web pages.
HTML uses tags and elements to organize content.
It defines headings, paragraphs, images, links, tables, and forms.
HTML works together with CSS for styling and JavaScript for interactivity.
It is the basic building block of web development.
Browsers like Chrome, Edge, and Firefox render HTML pages.
Caption-The First Step Toward Building Websites

CSS (Cascading Style Sheets) is used to style and design web pages. 
It controls colors, fonts, spacing, layouts, animations, and responsiveness. 
CSS improves user experience by making websites visually appealing and adaptable to different devices. 
It works alongside HTML to create modern, interactive, and professional frontend interfaces
Caption-CSS brings life to HTML by creating responsive and user-friendly web interfaces.

